{"ticker":"KVUE","updated":"2026-10-30T22:56:09Z","profile":{"longName":"Kenvue Inc.","shortName":"Kenvue Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kenvue.com","fullTimeEmployees":21780,"marketCap":37090136064,"trailingPE":22.453487,"forwardPE":15.5784855,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4071999,"pegRatio":1.55,"targetMeanPrice":19.5,"targetHighPrice":23.0,"targetLowPrice":18.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.03,"earningsGrowth":0.085,"grossMargins":0.58437,"operatingMargins":0.19418,"profitMargins":0.107609995,"totalRevenue":15408000000,"beta":0.447,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":20.13,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":14.06,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.29},"summary":"Kenvue Inc. operates as a consumer health company in the United States, rest of North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, and Latin America. It operates in three segments: Self Care, Skin Health and Beauty, and Essential Health. The company offers over-the-counter medicine for cough, cold and allergy, pain care, digestive health, smoking cessation, and eye care, as well as other naturally inspired and self-care products, digital diagnostics, and telemedicine; face and body care, hair, sun, and other care products; oral and baby care, women's health, wound care, and other essential health products; tampons; cosmetics; and vitamins and supplements. It sells its products under the Benadryl, Calpol, Motrin, Nicorette, Rhinocort, Tylenol, Zarbee's Naturals, and Zyrtec; Aveeno, Dr.Ci:Labo, Le Petit Marseillais, Lubriderm, Neutrogena, OGX, and Rogaine; BAND-AID, Carefree, Desitin, Johnson's, Listerine, o.b., and Stayfree; and ORSL, Clean & Clear, Versalie, Benylin, Daktarin, Imodium, Johnson's Baby, Johnson's Adult, Maui Moisture, Microlax, Motilium, Neosporin, Neostrata, Pepcid, Pulmicort, Regaine, Sudafed, and Visine/Vispring/Visclear brands. Kenvue Inc. was incorporated in 2022 and is headquartered in Summit, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"Kenvue Inc. 作為一家消費者健康公司，在美國、北美其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和拉丁美洲開展業務。它分為三個部門：自我護理、皮膚健康和美容以及基本健康。該公司提供用於咳嗽、感冒和過敏、疼痛護理、消化健康、戒菸和眼部護理的非處方藥，以及其他自然啟發和自我護理產品、數位診斷和遠距醫療；臉部和身體護理、頭髮、防曬和其他護理產品；口腔和嬰兒護理、女性健康、傷口護理和其他必需保健品；衛生棉條；化妝品；以及維生素和補充劑。它以 Benadryl、Calpol、Motrin、Nicorette、Rhinocort、Tylenol、Zarbee's Naturals 和 Zyrtec 銷售其產品； Aveeno、Dr.Ci:Labo、Le Petit Marseillais、Lubriderm、Neutrogena、OGX 和 Rogaine； BAND-AID、Mam、Desiin、Miron、Desi. ORSL、Clean & Clear、Versalie、Benylin、Daktarin、Imodium、Johnson's Baby、Johnson's Adult、Maui Moisture、Microlax、Motilium、Neosporin、Neostrata、Pepcid、Pulmicort、Regaine、Sudafed 和 Visine/Vispring/Visclear 品牌。 Kenvue Inc. 成立於 2022 年，總部位於新澤西州薩米特。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"居家及個人產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":20.66,"h":20.82,"l":20.59,"c":20.78,"v":11719600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":20.69,"h":20.785,"l":20.41,"c":20.45,"v":19118200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":20.53,"h":20.565,"l":20.26,"c":20.54,"v":16966400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":20.51,"h":20.69,"l":17.145,"c":18.62,"v":135445400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":18.75,"h":18.93,"l":18.2,"c":18.43,"v":56135000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":18.5,"h":18.97,"l":18.12,"c":18.87,"v":39520400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":18.88,"h":18.95,"l":18.05,"c":18.47,"v":25229000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":18.43,"h":19.04,"l":18.41,"c":18.85,"v":22265500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":18.82,"h":19.42,"l":18.77,"c":18.99,"v":26731000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":18.99,"h":19.01,"l":18.085,"c":18.25,"v":24893300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":18.35,"h":18.58,"l":18.0,"c":18.13,"v":19689000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":18.13,"h":18.615,"l":18.02,"c":18.34,"v":17820400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":18.18,"h":18.53,"l":18.05,"c":18.1,"v":27556700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":18.21,"h":18.59,"l":18.045,"c":18.34,"v":49475600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":17.71,"h":17.96,"l":16.885,"c":16.97,"v":76034200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":17.9,"h":18.19,"l":17.22,"c":17.24,"v":68556700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":17.51,"h":17.51,"l":16