.89B，調整後每股盈餘 $0.29，金佰利交易無指引"},{"title":"Kimberly-Clark completes $4.9 billion senior notes offering to support Kenvue deal","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Kimberly-Clark 完成 49 億美元高級票據發行以支持 Kenvue 交易"},{"title":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation (KMB) Closes $4.9B Senior Notes To Fund Kenvue Deal","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation (KMB) 完成 4.9B 美元優先票據，為 Kenvue 交易提供資金"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1944048/000194404826000030/kvue-20251228.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"At Kenvue, our purpose is to realize the extraordinary power of everyday care. As a global leader at the intersection of healthcare and consumer goods, we are the world's largest pure-play consumer health company by revenue with $15.1 billion in Net sales in the fiscal year 2025. By combining the power of science with meaningful consumer insights and our digital strategy, we empower consumers to live healthier lives every day. Built on more than a century of heritage and trusted by generations, our differentiated portfolio of iconic brands—including Aveeno , BAND-AID Brand, Johnson's , Listerine , Neutrogena , Nicorette , Tylenol , and Zyrtec —is backed by science and recommended by healthcare professionals, which further reinforces our consumers' connections to our brands.","zh":"在 Kenvue，我們的目標是實現日常護理的非凡力量。身為醫療保健和消費品交叉領域的全球領導者，我們是全球收入最大的純消費者健康公司，2025 財年的淨銷售額為 151 億美元。透過將科學的力量與有意義的消費者洞察和我們的數位策略相結合，我們使消費者每天都能過上更健康的生活。我們差異化的標誌性品牌組合（包括 Aveeno 、 BAND-AID Brand、Johnson's 、 Listerine 、 Neutrogena 、 Nicorette 、 Tylenol 和 Zyrtec ）建立在一個多世紀的傳統基礎上並受到幾代人的信賴，以科學為後盾，並得到醫療保健專業人士的推薦，這進一步加強了消費者與我們品牌的聯繫。"},{"en":"Our portfolio includes Self Care, Skin Health and Beauty, and Essential Health products, allowing us to connect with consumers across North America, Asia Pacific (\"APAC\"), Europe, Middle East, and Africa (\"EMEA\"), and Latin America (\"LATAM\") in their daily rituals and the moments that matter most. Our products are marketed across more than 165 countries worldwide.","zh":"我們的產品組合包括自我護理、皮膚健康和美容以及基本健康產品，使我們能夠在北美、亞太地區（“APAC”）、歐洲、中東和非洲（“EMEA”）以及拉丁美洲（“LATAM”）的消費者的日常習慣和最重要的時刻與他們建立聯繫。我們的產品銷往全球超過 165 個國家。"},{"en":"Our global scale and the breadth of our brand portfolio are complemented by our well-developed capabilities and accelerated through our digital strategy, allowing us to dynamically capitalize on and respond to current trends impacting our categories and geographic markets.","zh":"我們的全球規模和品牌組合的廣度與我們成熟的能力相輔相成，並透過我們的數位策略加速，使我們能夠動態地利用和應對影響我們的品類和地理市場的當前趨勢。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The consumer health and personal care sectors are large and dynamic, with a significant number of competitors that vary from well-established consumer packaged goods (\"CPG\") companies with well-known legacy businesses globally to emerging niche-oriented brands.","zh":"消費者健康和個人護理產業規模龐大且充滿活力，競爭對手數量眾多，從在全球擁有知名傳統業務的成熟消費品 (“CPG”) 公司到新興的利基品牌。"},{"en":"Given the breadth of our portfolio and global footprint, we compete with a broad set of competitors that include 1) consumer healthcare businesses that are either independent or part of larger pharmaceutical groups, 2) global CPG companies that operate in similar or adjacent categories, 3) regional companies that operate in our categories within the markets in which we compete, 4) generic OTC manufacturers and retailers', including our customers', private-label brands in both traditional retail and online, and 5) emerging niche-oriented brands in our categories with distribution either through traditional retail, online, or direct-to-consumer (\"DTC\") channels. Across our three reportable business segments, we experience significant degrees of competition.","zh":"鑑於我們的產品組合和全球足跡的廣度，我們與眾多競爭對手競爭，包括 1) 獨立的或隸屬於大型製藥集團的消費者保健業務，2) 在類似或相鄰類別中運營的全球 CPG 公司，3) 在我們競爭的市場中在我們的類別中運營的區域公司，4) 非處方藥製造商和零售商，包括我們的客戶、零售和在線的自有品牌我們類別中透過傳統零售、分銷的新興利基品牌，在線上或直接面向消費者（「DTC」）管道。在我們的三個可報告業務部門中，我們經歷著激烈的競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"Self Care","val":6378000000,"zh":"自我照顧"},{"name":"Essential Health","val":4632000000,"zh":"基本健康"},{"name":"Skin Health & Beauty","val":4114000000,"zh":"皮膚健康與美容"}],"total":15124000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"North America","val":7259000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":6460000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":3721000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":2775000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":1369000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":15124000000}},"peers":["KDP","AMCR","GEHC","HLN","TFC"]}}